        <p class="hero-philosophy" data-i18n="hero.philosophy">弘益人間</p>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
            <span data-i18n="hero.desc_1">18 years of sleepless nights. Not for profit, not for fame.</span><br>
            <span data-i18n="hero.desc_2">For the belief that technology should benefit all humanity.</span><br>
            <span data-i18n="hero.desc_3">Every standard, every simulator, every line of code — a gift to the world.</span>
        </p>
        <div class="hero-stats">
